From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:27:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 083/110] An open <details> stays open while its text is edited

Keyed by its source, an open <details> closed on every keystroke typed
inside it in the Split view. When an open block's key is gone after a
reparse, the open state moves to the block at the same place among those
with that heading and summary, if that block's source is new.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

